    "默认保持系统行为；配置长按后，该按钮的普通点击也会由 Blinker 接管。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Default keeps system behavior; with a long press set, plain clicks on that button are handled by Blinker too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认保持系统行为；配置长按后，该按钮的普通点击也会由 Blinker 接管。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认关闭。启用前请确认不会与系统或其他窗口管理工具的拖拽贴靠重复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. Before enabling, check that it will not duplicate snapping from macOS or another window manager."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。启用前请确认不会与系统或其他窗口管理工具的拖拽贴靠重复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "鼠标悬停时，放大按钮直接覆盖原生红绿灯，驻留后可点击；移开鼠标即收起。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hover to enlarge the controls over the original traffic lights. Click after the dwell delay; move away to dismiss."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "鼠标悬停时，放大按钮直接覆盖原生红绿灯，驻留后可点击；移开鼠标即收起。"
          }
        }
      }
